  "code": "from hamana.connector.db.hamana import HamanaConnector\nfrom hamana.connector.db.query import Query\n\n# initialise hamana's internal SQLite database (in-memory singleton connector)\nhamana_db = HamanaConnector()\n\n# build and execute the query\nquery = Query(\"SELECT id, amount FROM orders\")\nhamana_db.execute(query)\n\n# persist the query result into the internal database as table \"orders\"\nquery.to_sqlite(table_name=\"orders\")\n\nhamana_db.close()",
  "result_text": "```python\nfrom hamana.connector.db.hamana import HamanaConnector\nfrom hamana.connector.db.query import Query\n\n# initialise hamana's internal SQLite database (in-memory singleton connector)\nhamana_db = HamanaConnector()\n\n# build and execute the query\nquery = Query(\"SELECT id, amount FROM orders\")\nhamana_db.execute(query)\n\n# persist the query result into the internal database as table \"orders\"\nquery.to_sqlite(table_name=\"orders\")\n\nhamana_db.close()\n```",
